# PrepLoop environment overview. Placeholders only: never commit real values.
#
# Backend: copy services/api/.env.example to services/api/.env
#   (variables are prefixed PREPLOOP_ and read by app/core/config.py).
#
# Mobile: build-time values are passed with --dart-define (see README.md):
#   API_BASE_URL  e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8000 (web/desktop), http://10.0.2.2:8000 (Android emulator)
#   FLAVOR        development | staging | production (non-development requires https)
#   APP_NAME      display name override
#
# Secrets (AI provider keys, database passwords, signing keys) belong only in
# server-side environment variables or a secret manager, never in the mobile app.
